33
00:03:13.363 --> 00:03:22.777
<v Maya>Right. In Spark to Paper, the system separates the model's judgment, which is the chef deciding what an argument actually needs, from the deterministic operations.</v>

34
00:03:22.958 --> 00:03:23.659
